00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:13,828
At a melting or boiling point the change is reversible, so delta S is delta H over T. Melting ice: six thousand and ten over two seventy three, twenty two joules per kelvin per mole.

2
00:00:13,828 --> 00:00:20,104
Boiling water: forty thousand seven hundred over three seventy three, one hundred and nine.

3
00:00:20,104 --> 00:00:22,760
Boiling creates far more disorder.

4
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:31,380
And the third law: a perfect crystal at absolute zero has zero entropy, which gives entropy an absolute scale.

